WEBVTT

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.042
"October 21, 380 HE"

00:00:46.792 --> 00:00:48.542
Sister!

00:00:50.042 --> 00:00:52.500
Good morning, Sister!

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:53.875
Selka.

00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:58.417
Welcome, Selka.

00:00:58.417 --> 00:01:00.042
What brings you here today?

00:01:00.042 --> 00:01:04.542
Since it's so nice out,
I wanted to go to the eastern hill.

00:01:04.542 --> 00:01:07.167
And Kirito can come too, right?

00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:14.917
It's such a lovely day.

00:01:14.917 --> 00:01:17.625
It'd be a shame for him to spend it inside.

00:01:19.375 --> 00:01:23.042
Shall we go, Kirito?

00:02:55.083 --> 00:02:59.083
"In the Far North"

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:06.458
All right.

00:03:06.458 --> 00:03:08.375
Let's get going.

00:03:15.833 --> 00:03:18.917
I'm sorry. I'll get them for you right away.

00:03:46.292 --> 00:03:49.542
Hold on tight so you don't drop them, all right?

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:58.083
You don't think he'll be cold?

00:03:58.083 --> 00:04:01.750
Really. You're such a worrywart.

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:04.875
You've piled enough clothes on him
to make him sweat.

00:04:04.875 --> 00:04:06.625
Right, Kirito?

00:04:11.375 --> 00:04:14.083
Eugeo, you think so, too, right?

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.458
It's beautiful.

00:04:32.458 --> 00:04:37.417
Far more beautiful than any painting
on the Cathedral's walls.

00:04:37.417 --> 00:04:41.125
It's the world you saved, Kirito.

00:04:42.875 --> 00:04:44.417
This is bad, Mr. Kiku!

00:04:44.417 --> 00:04:48.250
If they sever the main power line,
it'll cause a surge!

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:50.875
The Lightcube Cluster is protected, but...

00:04:50.875 --> 00:04:54.167
...the surge will hit Kirigaya's STL in Subcon!

00:04:54.167 --> 00:04:56.667
His Fluctlight will get fried!

00:04:57.917 --> 00:05:00.125
I'll handle the lockdown procedure!

00:05:00.125 --> 00:05:04.375
Higa, you take Dr. Kojiro and Asuna
and evacuate to the Upper Shaft.

00:05:04.375 --> 00:05:05.792
Keep Kirito safe.

00:05:05.792 --> 00:05:07.083
Asuna?

00:05:07.083 --> 00:05:08.167
Kirito.

00:05:08.167 --> 00:05:11.833
It's no good, they're cutting the power!
The screw propellers are going to stop!

00:05:25.625 --> 00:05:26.875
Kirito!

00:05:28.083 --> 00:05:31.250
Kirito!

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:34.333
You've saved my life,
so now you must see things through!

00:05:34.333 --> 00:05:35.792
Kirito!

00:05:39.042 --> 00:05:40.625
Kirito.

00:05:42.542 --> 00:05:44.542
Little one.

00:05:44.542 --> 00:05:46.208
Uncle.

00:05:47.208 --> 00:05:49.000
What happened?

00:05:50.792 --> 00:05:54.208
This is the gravest emergency
since the Axiom Church was founded.

00:05:54.208 --> 00:05:59.250
The pontifex was defeated by two elite
disciples and has left the Human Empire.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:00.917
What did you say?

00:06:00.917 --> 00:06:03.667
How... How is that possible?

00:06:03.667 --> 00:06:05.500
And that's not all.

00:06:05.500 --> 00:06:11.167
Prime Senator Chudelkin has also been killed,
and the Senate has ceased to function.

00:06:11.167 --> 00:06:16.417
Why did those disciples tempt the wrath
of the gods by doing such a thing?

00:06:16.417 --> 00:06:21.292
Because the pontifex was pursuing a horrific
plan to convert half of the population

00:06:21.292 --> 00:06:23.958
into monstrous, sword-shaped weapons.

00:06:23.958 --> 00:06:29.083
Her Eminence the pontifex
had such a heinous scheme in motion?

00:06:29.083 --> 00:06:30.958
Unbelievable.

00:06:30.958 --> 00:06:35.333
Sir Bercouli, where are the two
who murdered Her Eminence?

00:06:35.333 --> 00:06:38.167
They must be captured and interrogated!

00:06:38.167 --> 00:06:40.750
There's no time to deal with them right now.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:46.417
What do you think will happen when the Dark
Territory finds out the pontifex is gone?

00:06:46.417 --> 00:06:50.625
Not to mention, the earlier battles
with those swordsmen and the Dark Territory

00:06:50.625 --> 00:06:53.667
have halved the Integrity Knights' ranks.

00:06:53.667 --> 00:06:56.542
If we were to be attacked
by the Dark Territory in this state,

00:06:56.542 --> 00:06:59.083
we couldn't defend against them on our own.

00:06:59.083 --> 00:07:02.542
Then what should we do?

00:07:02.542 --> 00:07:05.958
First, we're going to restore the decimated
Order of the Integrity Knights.

00:07:05.958 --> 00:07:09.833
Next, we'll rebuild the Imperial Knights
of the four empires.

00:07:09.833 --> 00:07:15.542
They'll need to be retrained. Since there's
not nearly enough Integrity Knights.

00:07:15.542 --> 00:07:18.125
I'm sure some of you are unhappy about this,

00:07:18.125 --> 00:07:20.708
but right now, saving the
people is our top priority.

00:07:20.708 --> 00:07:23.625
I ask that you lend me your strength.

00:07:23.625 --> 00:07:24.833
Sir!

00:07:28.208 --> 00:07:30.708
"June 9, 380 HE"

00:07:48.833 --> 00:07:52.750
Kirito... I wonder if he's hungry.

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:57.000
Hey, is it true that the rebel
swordsman is still alive?

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:00.125
Yeah. But I hear he's in a coma.

00:08:00.125 --> 00:08:03.667
It's important that we prepare
for the Dark Territory's invasion,

00:08:03.667 --> 00:08:08.750
but shouldn't we execute the rebel
who defied the Axiom Church?

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:12.375
What is Knight Commander Bercouli thinking?

00:08:14.125 --> 00:08:17.167
It's not safe for Kirito here.

00:08:35.833 --> 00:08:38.083
Let's go to Rulid Village.

00:08:38.083 --> 00:08:40.833
Since it's where Eugeo and I were born,

00:08:40.833 --> 00:08:43.625
they might accept us there.

00:09:00.375 --> 00:09:01.833
Hold on!

00:09:01.833 --> 00:09:04.708
Strangers aren't allowed to enter our village!

00:09:11.125 --> 00:09:12.625
This is...

00:09:14.792 --> 00:09:17.417
You... You can't be...

00:09:17.417 --> 00:09:22.625
I am Alice. I'd like you to summon
the village elder, Gasuft Zuberg.

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:42.250
Alice.

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:43.958
Is that you?

00:09:45.083 --> 00:09:46.250
Yes.

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:48.708
Why are you here?

00:09:48.708 --> 00:09:50.917
Have you been absolved of your crime?

00:09:50.917 --> 00:09:54.167
As punishment for my crime,

00:09:54.167 --> 00:09:57.750
I've lost all memory
of having lived in this village.

00:09:57.750 --> 00:10:02.333
Whether or not that means my crime
has been absolved, I can't say.

00:10:02.333 --> 00:10:07.417
But at this time, I have nowhere
else to go but this village.

00:10:11.875 --> 00:10:13.417
Begone.

00:10:13.417 --> 00:10:16.500
We can't allow a criminal to live here.

00:10:26.083 --> 00:10:27.500
Sister?

00:10:31.667 --> 00:10:35.542
It's nothing. Shall we head back?

00:10:36.542 --> 00:10:37.792
Okay.

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:54.667
What's the matter, Selka?

00:10:54.667 --> 00:10:57.500
Is something troubling you?

00:10:57.500 --> 00:11:02.167
Well, you see, Mr. Barbossa wants to ask you

00:11:02.167 --> 00:11:05.375
to help remove another tree from that clearing.

00:11:05.375 --> 00:11:08.292
What, is that all?

00:11:08.292 --> 00:11:10.833
You don't have to be worried about that.

00:11:10.833 --> 00:11:14.125
But... those people are so selfish!

00:11:14.125 --> 00:11:18.875
Mr. Barbossa and Mr. Ridack
won't even let you live in the village,

00:11:18.875 --> 00:11:21.958
but they don't hesitate to ask for
your help when they're in trouble.

00:11:25.958 --> 00:11:27.917
It's all right, Selka.

00:11:27.917 --> 00:11:32.292
I'm just grateful that they're allowing us
to live near the village.

00:11:32.292 --> 00:11:36.625
Sister, I'll complete my
training period next year,

00:11:36.625 --> 00:11:39.917
and though it won't be much,
I'll start earning a wage.

00:11:39.917 --> 00:11:44.375
When that happens, you won't have
to help those people anymore, okay?

00:11:44.375 --> 00:11:49.333
You and Kirito... I'll... I'll always...

00:11:50.833 --> 00:11:52.417
Thank you.

00:11:52.417 --> 00:11:58.833
But just having you close by
is enough to make me happy...

00:11:58.833 --> 00:12:00.333
Selka.

00:12:12.167 --> 00:12:14.667
Why is this taking so long?

00:12:14.667 --> 00:12:17.417
While you've been wasting
time here, Ridack's men

00:12:17.417 --> 00:12:19.583
have expanded his land 20 mels
in all directions!

00:12:19.583 --> 00:12:21.875
Hello, Mr. Barbossa.

00:12:24.792 --> 00:12:27.625
Alice, so good of you to come!

00:12:27.625 --> 00:12:30.083
I heard that you wished to see me.

00:12:31.042 --> 00:12:33.125
Look. You can see it, can't you?

00:12:33.125 --> 00:12:38.542
We've been toiling over that pesky
platinum oak since yesterday morning.

00:12:38.542 --> 00:12:43.375
Even with ten grown men hacking at it,
they've hardly made a dent in it.

00:12:43.375 --> 00:12:44.708
And so...

00:12:44.708 --> 00:12:47.208
I know we have a once-a-month arrangement,

00:12:47.208 --> 00:12:52.333
but I wonder if you could
do me a favor just this once, Alice?

00:12:53.958 --> 00:12:56.708
Very well, Mr. Barbossa.

00:12:56.708 --> 00:12:59.875
If it's just this once.

00:12:59.875 --> 00:13:02.292
I really owe you, Alice!

00:13:23.125 --> 00:13:24.792
I'm sorry, Kirito.

00:13:24.792 --> 00:13:28.042
I'd like to borrow your sword for a little bit.

00:13:42.333 --> 00:13:43.792
Thank you.

00:13:49.333 --> 00:13:53.625
Hey now! You really think you can cut down
a platinum oak with that flimsy sword?

00:13:53.625 --> 00:13:55.750
That sword's going to snap in two!

00:14:09.375 --> 00:14:12.042
What's that? Did she miss?

00:14:14.958 --> 00:14:17.958
It's going to fall that direction.

00:14:17.958 --> 00:14:19.542
What are you--?

00:14:41.083 --> 00:14:42.250
Mag...

00:14:42.250 --> 00:14:43.500
Magnif...

00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:45.417
Magnificent!

00:14:45.417 --> 00:14:49.333
What splendid skills you have!
That was simply divine!

00:14:49.333 --> 00:14:51.042
What do you say, Alice?

00:14:51.042 --> 00:14:54.375
I'll double your fee,
so instead of once a month,

00:14:54.375 --> 00:14:58.792
could you help out once a week--
no, make that once a day?

00:14:58.792 --> 00:15:00.000
No.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.000
The amount you're paying me now is sufficient.

00:15:08.708 --> 00:15:10.250
My payment.

00:15:11.792 --> 00:15:14.125
That's right, that's right!

00:15:17.375 --> 00:15:19.125
Thank you very much.

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:21.542
Kirito!

00:15:27.125 --> 00:15:29.708
--What's this? It's really heavy!
--No wonder even a woman like that

00:15:29.708 --> 00:15:32.542
can fell a platinum oak with one blow, right?

00:15:32.542 --> 00:15:33.833
Let me.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.500
That sword belongs to Kirito.

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.292
Give it back to him at once.

00:15:49.458 --> 00:15:55.000
Look, we did ask that guy to lend us his sword!

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:58.125
And he was generous enough to agree.

00:15:58.125 --> 00:16:01.125
Going, "Ah. Ah." You know?

00:16:06.958 --> 00:16:10.125
Fine then! No need to look so angry.

00:16:32.708 --> 00:16:39.708
What in the world did we fight for,
suffering such unbearable pain?

00:16:41.208 --> 00:16:44.083
Eugeo lost his life.

00:16:44.083 --> 00:16:47.208
Kirito lost the ability to speak
and his emotions.

00:16:47.208 --> 00:16:51.583
What did we go so far to protect?

00:17:14.917 --> 00:17:16.083
Amayori.

00:17:16.083 --> 00:17:18.208
You've gained a bit of weight.

00:17:18.208 --> 00:17:20.708
You've been gorging on
too many fish at the lake.

00:17:29.167 --> 00:17:31.500
Good night, Amayori.

00:17:47.417 --> 00:17:48.542
Here.

00:17:55.708 --> 00:17:57.583
Take your time eating, all right?

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.375
Is that...?

00:18:20.958 --> 00:18:24.125
Amayori's elder brother, Takiguri.

00:18:24.125 --> 00:18:25.667
Which means...

00:18:29.875 --> 00:18:34.083
I'm impressed you found this place.
What do you want...

00:18:34.083 --> 00:18:36.667
...Eldrie Synthesis Thirty-One?

00:18:37.708 --> 00:18:40.167
It's been quite a while...

00:18:40.167 --> 00:18:42.917
...my mentor, Lady Alice.

00:18:45.958 --> 00:18:50.292
So how did you find this place?

00:18:50.292 --> 00:18:56.542
I'm sure the Order can't afford to send
dragons all over just to track me down.

00:18:56.542 --> 00:19:03.292
I followed the bond between our souls,
or so I'd like to say.

00:19:03.292 --> 00:19:06.167
But unfortunately,
it was a complete coincidence.

00:19:06.167 --> 00:19:13.125
Recently, we've learned that goblins and orcs
have been mobilizing in the north.

00:19:13.125 --> 00:19:18.500
On the Knight Commander's orders, we've
collapsed the caves to the north, south, and west,

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:24.042
but I've come to make sure
they don't try to dig them out again.

00:19:24.042 --> 00:19:28.583
So were you able to determine
the forces of darkness' actions?

00:19:28.583 --> 00:19:32.458
I spent a full day patrolling
the perimeters of the cave,

00:19:32.458 --> 00:19:36.542
but I didn't spot a single goblin or orc.

00:19:36.542 --> 00:19:40.458
The interior of the cave was filled
with rocks to the ceiling.

00:19:40.458 --> 00:19:46.625
Afterward, when I mounted to return to
the capital, Takiguri began acting strangely.

00:19:46.625 --> 00:19:51.083
When I allowed him to go where he wished,
this is where we ended up landing.

00:19:51.083 --> 00:19:55.125
Now that I've been reunited with you,

00:19:55.125 --> 00:19:58.583
it is my obligation to say to you...

00:19:58.583 --> 00:20:01.375
Lady Alice, please return to the Knights!

00:20:01.375 --> 00:20:06.208
We need your sword more than
we need an army of thousands!

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:08.792
I can't.

00:20:08.792 --> 00:20:10.292
But why not?

00:20:12.375 --> 00:20:14.542
Is it because of that man?

00:20:14.542 --> 00:20:18.667
The man who broke out of the Cathedral prison
and raised his treacherous blade

00:20:18.667 --> 00:20:23.083
against so many knights and senators,
not to mention the pontifex herself?

00:20:23.083 --> 00:20:26.708
So he's still leading your heart astray?

00:20:26.708 --> 00:20:30.375
If so, then I shall eliminate
the source of that confusion

00:20:30.375 --> 00:20:33.083
right here, this very instant!

00:20:33.083 --> 00:20:35.250
Stop it.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:39.375
He, too, fought out of
a sense of personal justice.

00:20:39.375 --> 00:20:43.375
Otherwise, how could we,
the mighty Integrity Knights,

00:20:43.375 --> 00:20:47.542
even the Knight Commander himself,
have all been defeated, one after another?

00:20:47.542 --> 00:20:52.667
You fought him yourself, so surely
you sensed the weight of his sword!

00:20:52.667 --> 00:20:57.833
If that's true, then why won't this man
take up his sword in battle now?

00:20:57.833 --> 00:21:00.708
Why would he allow himself
to be reduced to such a pathetic state,

00:21:00.708 --> 00:21:04.292
and shackle you, Lady Alice,
to these hinterlands?

00:21:04.292 --> 00:21:08.375
If it's true that he killed Administrator
for the sake of the people,

00:21:08.375 --> 00:21:12.917
then isn't it his duty to go to
the Eastern Gate this moment?

00:21:14.208 --> 00:21:17.458
Forgive me, Eldrie.

00:21:17.458 --> 00:21:21.250
I simply cannot go with you.

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:23.667
It has nothing to do with Kirito's condition.

00:21:23.667 --> 00:21:26.333
I can no longer wield my sword.

00:21:26.333 --> 00:21:28.250
That's all there is to it.

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:30.708
If I were to cross swords with you now,

00:21:30.708 --> 00:21:33.625
I most likely wouldn't last three strikes.

00:21:33.625 --> 00:21:35.167
Is that so?

00:21:35.167 --> 00:21:38.250
Then I won't press you further.

00:21:44.875 --> 00:21:47.833
I bid you farewell, my mentor.

00:21:47.833 --> 00:21:54.208
I, Eldrie, shall never forget as long as I live the
secret sword skills and techniques you taught me.

00:21:54.208 --> 00:21:57.833
Take care. I pray that you'll be safe.

00:22:22.125 --> 00:22:25.125
I'm sorry. You must be tired.

00:22:25.125 --> 00:22:27.750
Then let's go to bed, shall we?

00:22:50.958 --> 00:22:53.625
Tell me, Kirito.

00:22:54.750 --> 00:22:56.542
What should I do?

00:22:58.792 --> 00:23:01.792
What should I...?

00:23:12.708 --> 00:23:14.042
Kirito?

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:19.458
What's wrong, Kirito?

00:23:38.167 --> 00:23:42.208
Is it an attack by the Dark Territory?

00:23:43.417 --> 00:23:46.625
Selka!

00:23:48.417 --> 00:23:52.150
Next time: "Raids."
